  "result": "Excellent! All 91 tests pass. I've added comprehensive line-level discount support:\n\n**Key additions:**\n\n**Error handling:**\n- `DISCOUNT_INVALID` \u2014 discount must be a number from 0-100\n\n**Core functions:**\n\n1. **`lineDiscount(line)`** \u2014 Calculates discount amount for a line\n   - Formula: `lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100`\n   - Clamped between 0 and the line total (prevents negative results)\n\n2. **`invoiceTotals(invoice)`** \u2014 Updated to return:\n   - `subtotal` \u2014 sum of line totals\n   - `discount` \u2014 sum of line discounts\n   - `total` \u2014 subtotal - discount (clamped at 0)\n\n3. **`createInvoice` and `addLine`** \u2014 Now accept `discountPercent`\n   - Optional in input (defaults to 0)\n   - Validates: must be a number between 0-100\n   - Stored on each line\n\n4. **`renderInvoiceText(invoice)`** \u2014 Enhanced rendering\n   - Shows discount on individual lines: `(12.5% off: -\u20ac95.00)`\n   - Shows subtotal and discount lines when discounts apply\n   - Omits subtotal/discount rows when no discounts\n\n**Safety guarantees:**\n- No computed amount can go below zero (all amounts clamped at 0)\n- Discounts can't exceed the line total\n- Total can't be negative even with invalid data\n\n**Test coverage:** 91 total tests including:\n- Discount validation (negative, over 100, non-numeric)\n- Discount calculations (integer and decimal percentages)\n- Edge cases (100% discount, empty invoices, clamping)\n- Rendering with and without discounts\n\nAll 91 tests pass \u2713",
